COMPILATION OF: E52PD

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PD

   1 a 0000 E52PD: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PD (picture operand p'zz9': lowercase source; expect
   3 a 0006       02 03 00 03 5A 5A 39 (uppercase storage re-check)) */
   4 a 0006    /* P3-3 scale-0 family: console EDIT, data = literal + fixed-bin
   5 a 0006       expression (P086K/LOAN2-115 law), format = a + picture; the
   6 a 0006       picture operand under test is the ONE varying element. */
   7 c 0006    dcl m fixed binary, y fixed binary;
   8 c 0006    put edit('|',100*m+y)(a,p'zz9');
   9 a 0039 end E52PD;

CODE SIZE = 003C
DATA AREA = 0011
FREE SYMS = 38A6
END  COMPILATION
